{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578290/extras/ddf61c63c8793a6cae1192eed437dbd1.avif?t=1769791703\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578290/extras_big/ddf61c63c8793a6cae1192eed437dbd1.avif?t=1769791703 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ransom VonGarland must journey\u00a0to Mayhem Island and the ruins of VonGarland Castle to find her brother and uncover the truth of what Plasmadine\u00a0corporation is doing on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a survival horror action platformer with some Metroidvania elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >super Metroid meets RE4 (with a sprinkling of Castlevania)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you must fight your way through hordes of enemies and bosses and solve puzzles to reach VonGarland castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >find keys &amp; items to help you reach new\u00a0areas of Mayhem Island.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >discover new weapons\u00a0to defeat enemies more easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >conserve ammo by taking on enemies\u00a0in close combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>enter a world of\u00a0survival horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock awesome new weapons, skills &amp; powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find items, keys &amp; cranks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unlock new accessories and costumes\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/357829